  ### 8) Risks and mitigations

  | Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
  |---|---|---|
  | Preview-selection mapping is imperfect | Wrong range edited | Start with deterministic line-span mapping and explicit fallback behavior; add visual
  feedback on target lines |
  | Security regressions in webview | XSS/resource abuse | Strict CSP, sanitizer, localResourceRoots restrictions, payload validation, security tests |
  | Workflow regressions (diff/create-file/link behaviors) | User frustration | Keep explicit non-markdown/untitled/diff guards in open handler;
  provide Open Source action |
  | Undo stack fragmentation | Poor editing UX | Apply minimal edits per action; avoid multi-step hidden edits |
  | Dependency bloat | Maintenance burden | Limit to essential parser/highlighter/sanitizer; document why each dependency exists |
  | Accessibility regressions | Exclusion and usability issues | Implement keyboard/focus checks early and run manual a11y checklist each milestone |

